    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a827ca763fdd332095178ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“青春杯”第一战。\n大树快车展现了要获胜下去直到\nBANG！掉＜First＞队的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a13aa72dc9542ce6caf02c6e7c7e100e586c2d8d599f9edd69da279df4ccfb2c",
